OL,3,GNEWSALone male stoat captured on Orkney
OL,4,Aisland after seven-month hunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lone stoat has been caught after a
OL,7,Fseven-month hunt by trappers in Orkney.
OL,9,FThe creature, which is not native to
OL,10,Fthe islands and consider invasive, was
OL,11,Ffirst spotted in Rousay in May.
OL,13,FIt was captured on Friday and removed
OL,14,Ffrom the island by the Orkney Native
OL,15,FWildlife Project (ONWP), which has also
OL,16,Fcaught thousands of stoats on the
OL,17,FOrkney mainland as part of a #15m
OL,18,Feradication scheme set up in 2019.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
