OL,3,GNEWSALone male stoat captured on Orkney
OL,4,Aisland after seven-month hunt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe response to capture the animal
OL,7,Finvolved targeted trapping, dog
OL,8,Fsearches, AI-assisted trail cameras and
OL,9,Fother monitoring tools, and support
OL,10,Ffrom trained volunteers from the
OL,11,Fcommunity.
